            "body": "langmap is a way switch between language, not keyboard layout. Using langmap will  be causing more confusion, for example, \r\n```\r\nvim.o.langmap = 'ki,il'\r\nvim.o.langremap = false\r\nvim.keymap.set(\"n\", \"<leader>sk\", ...)\r\n```\r\nwhen you typed <leader>sk, `k` will treat as `i`",
